{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "DreamBreaker",
    "steam_appid": 3347610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aDreamBreaker\u300b is a turn-based card game with rogue elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must select three heroes to form a team, complete investigations within a limited time, locate the demon lord's lair, and seal it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cycle allows players to choose different companions and exploration routes, discovering unique skills and items. Experience a vast array of possibilities through diverse combinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 14 heroes, each with completely different card strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select 3 heroes each cycle to form your team and experience a unique adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347610/extras/bb206188d77881c69084183f36434d85.avif?t=1754469805\" width=616 height=406 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Mission Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers many missions, each with unique skills or passives to build your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The limited time may not be enough to complete all missions, so you need to flexibly choose your mission route based on hero characteristics and the final challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347610/extras/83a3eb05a975786790a2137f1f022bb9.avif?t=1754469805\" width=616 height=406 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative Combat Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional card games, there are no draw piles or discard piles. At the start of the game, all cards are dealt to the player's hand, and after playing a card, the player must perform a &quot;Rest&quot; action to retrieve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compared to card games, &lt;Dream Breaker&gt; has a pace more akin to turn-based games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It boldly incorporates special mechanics such as dual-skill cards, Time-Order and resonance. aiming to deliver a completely unique combat experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347610/extras/d4f3285642f006cdef4f8d438b427acc.avif?t=1754469805\" width=616 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an unbeatable deck and unleash a storm of strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aDreamBreaker\u300b is a turn-based card game with rogue elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must select three heroes to form a team, complete investigations within a limited time, locate the demon lord's lair, and seal it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cycle allows players to choose different companions and exploration routes, discovering unique skills and items. Experience a vast array of possibilities through diverse combinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 14 heroes, each with completely different card strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select 3 heroes each cycle to form your team and experience a unique adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347610/extras/bb206188d77881c69084183f36434d85.avif?t=1754469805\" width=616 height=406 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Mission Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers many missions, each with unique skills or passives to build your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The limited time may not be enough to complete all missions, so you need to flexibly choose your mission route based on hero characteristics and the final challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347610/extras/83a3eb05a975786790a2137f1f022bb9.avif?t=1754469805\" width=616 height=406 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative Combat Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional card games, there are no draw piles or discard piles. At the start of the game, all cards are dealt to the player's hand, and after playing a card, the player must perform a &quot;Rest&quot; action to retrieve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compared to card games, &lt;Dream Breaker&gt; has a pace more akin to turn-based games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It boldly incorporates special mechanics such as dual-skill cards, Time-Order and resonance. aiming to deliver a completely unique combat experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347610/extras/d4f3285642f006cdef4f8d438b427acc.avif?t=1754469805\" width=616 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an unbeatable deck and unleash a storm of strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "DreamBreaker is a rogue-like turn-based card-building game. Each hero has unique characteristics, and form different combinations to challenge and seal the demon lord. Innovative combat mechanics create a unique turn-based experience!",
